1
00:00:56,670 --> 00:00:58,010
This thing won't break easily.

2
00:00:58,710 --> 00:01:00,220
I must break through the barrier

3
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:01,660
before the seal is complete.

4
00:01:11,290 --> 00:01:11,750
Master.

5
00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:14,980
Qi Fengyin is trying to break the barrier.

6
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,730
We must activate the Wanjun Lock first.

7
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:18,940
Stay focused!

8
00:01:19,110 --> 00:01:19,530
Yes, Master!

9
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:21,130
Activate the Wanjun Lock!

10
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:54,340
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

11
00:01:56,380 --> 00:02:02,340
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

12
00:02:03,380 --> 00:02:07,620
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

13
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:18,860
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

14
00:02:19,220 --> 00:02:25,980
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

15
00:02:27,220 --> 00:02:33,860
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

16
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:41,900
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

17
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:50,020
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

18
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:56,580
[Blossom in Darkness]

19
00:02:56,580 --> 00:02:58,580
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

20
00:02:58,580 --> 00:03:01,580
[Episode 2]

21
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,500
That rotten Qi Fengyin!

22
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,500
I told him I wouldn't run away!

23
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,250
Yet he planted me in a place like this!

24
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,250
Once the Wanjun Lock is fully formed,

25
00:03:17,110 --> 00:03:17,910
all of Mount Qihuang

26
00:03:17,910 --> 00:03:18,980
will be sealed up tight.

27
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,370
Not even a breeze will get through.

28
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:21,860
Being planted here

29
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,300
with that awful devil

30
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:23,820
is bad enough.

31
00:03:24,150 --> 00:03:25,610
But Master will never wake up.

32
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,980
You can't break free on your own.

33
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:39,610
How are you still alive?

34
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:42,330
I'm a mighty ancient demon.

35
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,820
No one alive is powerful enough to kill me.

36
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,670
You took over Master's stuffed doll.

37
00:03:47,670 --> 00:03:48,430
I could've let that slide.

38
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,770
What exactly do you want?

39
00:03:50,350 --> 00:03:51,770
Who wants this ugly doll?

40
00:03:51,950 --> 00:03:53,330
When you were being hunted,

41
00:03:53,510 --> 00:03:55,380
I panicked and possessed the wrong body.

42
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:56,880
Promise me

43
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,260
you'll get me out of here.

44
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,450
And stuff me with more cotton

45
00:04:00,790 --> 00:04:02,980
so I look like a stunning beauty.

46
00:04:03,510 --> 00:04:04,610
Then I'll set you free.

47
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,330
We're running out of time.

48
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:14,100
Fine, fine! I promise!

49
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:47,410
Madam!

50
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,220
It seems

51
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:55,900
even with the Tidal Divine Artifact,

52
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,460
the Five Great Sects can't defeat Qi Fengyin.

53
00:04:58,950 --> 00:05:00,290
The immortal sects are doomed.

54
00:05:00,950 --> 00:05:02,170
If we keep fighting alongside them,

55
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,490
we'll lose everything.

56
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,980
Su Hexiang's immortal power is gone.

57
00:05:14,190 --> 00:05:14,660
Master.

58
00:05:15,070 --> 00:05:16,340
The array is forming more slowly.

59
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,170
Stay focused!

60
00:05:21,750 --> 00:05:22,490
Are you sure you can do this?

61
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,050
I'm even more desperate to

62
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:25,780
get out of here than you are.

63
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,100
I've been looking everywhere for you.

64
00:05:34,750 --> 00:05:36,410
I only came to try my luck.

65
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,340
I never thought you'd still be alive.

66
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:40,020
Su Hexiang?

67
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:41,850
What are you doing here?

68
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:44,410
Shouldn't all the immortal sects

69
00:05:44,750 --> 00:05:45,620
be working together

70
00:05:45,620 --> 00:05:46,610
to seal Mount Qihuang?

71
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:48,900
If Qi Fengyin weren't

72
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,900
busy fighting the Wanjun Lock,

73
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,700
do you think I'd risk

74
00:05:52,750 --> 00:05:53,780
entering Mount Qihuang?

75
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:55,780
How else would I have found you?

76
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,290
You're incredibly powerful.

77
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:22,830
Hardly anyone in this world

78
00:06:22,830 --> 00:06:23,540
can stand against you.

79
00:06:23,950 --> 00:06:24,850
Why risk everything

80
00:06:24,870 --> 00:06:25,660
over a single herb?

81
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:27,610
Whether you're worth eating

82
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:30,540
depends entirely on my mood.

83
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,580
You're about to die,

84
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,580
yet you're still struggling.

85
00:06:56,870 --> 00:06:58,490
Instead of falling into that devil's hands,

86
00:06:59,190 --> 00:07:00,170
you'd be better off

87
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:00,930
letting me capture you.

88
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:02,460
I'll even grant your wish

89
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,370
and bring your master back to life.

90
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,970
If you're going to lie to me,

91
00:07:05,970 --> 00:07:06,980
at least make it believable.

92
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,790
Why save my master if you're going to eat me?

93
00:07:08,870 --> 00:07:10,260
My master cares deeply about me.

94
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:11,700
He'd kill you to avenge my death.

95
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:12,780
I'm not falling for that!

96
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,490
At least now you know the truth.

97
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:19,170
I'll only take your herb core.

98
00:07:19,510 --> 00:07:20,980
You won't feel a thing.

99
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,100
Qi Fengyin?

100
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,140
If you're here,

101
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,170
how will you handle the Wanjun Lock?

102
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,100
What about the seal?

103
00:08:02,550 --> 00:08:03,380
Once the array is complete,

104
00:08:03,430 --> 00:08:04,330
we'll be trapped here forever!

105
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:04,940
We'll never escape!

106
00:08:05,230 --> 00:08:06,600
Just make sure the mystical flower

107
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:07,210
stays safe.

108
00:08:08,470 --> 00:08:09,740
Leave everything else to me.

109
00:08:11,050 --> 00:08:12,290
I have no desire to make an enemy of you.

110
00:08:12,990 --> 00:08:14,330
I only want to take that girl.

111
00:08:14,670 --> 00:08:15,290
Surely the Wanjun Lock

112
00:08:15,670 --> 00:08:16,650
matters more to you

113
00:08:16,670 --> 00:08:17,410
than she does.

114
00:09:46,190 --> 00:09:47,930
No wonder you're the devil who slaughtered the immortal sects.

115
00:09:48,430 --> 00:09:50,140
Even without the Devil Incarnate powers,

116
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:52,220
you're too strong for me to defeat alone.

117
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,460
I overestimated myself.

118
00:10:37,950 --> 00:10:38,930
I'll find a way

119
00:10:38,950 --> 00:10:39,530
to survive on my own.

120
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:40,460
You should focus on dealing with

121
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,380
the Wanjun Lock array.

122
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:42,290
That no longer matters.

123
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:44,930
I have the Wanjun Lock.

124
00:10:47,310 --> 00:10:48,530
The barrier is broken.

125
00:11:20,550 --> 00:11:21,140
Master.

126
00:11:21,710 --> 00:11:22,050
You...

127
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,220
That devil...

128
00:11:26,430 --> 00:11:28,100
He's finally been unleashed.

129
00:11:33,020 --> 00:11:35,180
[Mount Qihuang]

130
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:52,740
The Wanjun Lock seems to be suppressing his power.

131
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:07,100
Take me to the person we just saw.

132
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,140
You mean Su Hexiang?

133
00:12:10,910 --> 00:12:12,140
You want me to take you to her?

134
00:12:13,310 --> 00:12:14,860
Now that Mount Qihuang's seal is broken,

135
00:12:15,070 --> 00:12:16,530
the immortal sects will surely fight back.

136
00:12:16,670 --> 00:12:18,810
Qi Fengyin has been trapped here for so long.

137
00:12:19,070 --> 00:12:20,140
He knows nothing of the outside world.

138
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:22,340
If I can trick him into going to Mount Zhaowu...

139
00:12:23,310 --> 00:12:23,810
Wait for me.

140
00:12:26,590 --> 00:12:27,430
At a time like this,

141
00:12:27,430 --> 00:12:28,500
why are you still carrying that thing?

142
00:12:29,070 --> 00:12:30,620
She's a disciple of the immortal sects.

143
00:12:30,910 --> 00:12:32,340
Once we're on their territory,

144
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:34,050
she'll team up with those wretched immortals

145
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:34,770
to plot against you

146
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:35,460
and trick you!

147
00:12:35,710 --> 00:12:37,410
I'm the mighty ancient demon.

148
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:39,100
The immortal cultivators are my sworn enemies.

149
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,340
I'll make sure to clear away

150
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,980
every obstacle and trap in your path.

151
00:12:42,170 --> 00:12:43,260
That wretched doll.

152
00:12:43,590 --> 00:12:44,740
It switched sides just like that.

153
00:12:53,620 --> 00:12:55,740
[Youyou]

154
00:13:05,550 --> 00:13:06,650
I have a human body now!

155
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,020
From now on, I'm a mighty demon,

156
00:13:09,310 --> 00:13:10,380
and you're the greatest mighty demon of all!

157
00:13:10,670 --> 00:13:12,100
You are my lord!

158
00:13:13,670 --> 00:13:14,620
Lord?

159
00:13:15,070 --> 00:13:16,430
You call yourself a mighty demon,

160
00:13:16,740 --> 00:13:17,930
yet you're happy to be someone's servant?

161
00:13:17,970 --> 00:13:18,620
Have you no shame?

162
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:19,740
What do you know?

163
00:13:19,830 --> 00:13:21,340
I've survived for thousands of years

164
00:13:21,590 --> 00:13:22,500
because I know when

165
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:24,290
to swallow my pride and have no shame.

166
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:25,770
Greetings, My Lord.

167
00:13:26,550 --> 00:13:27,860
Just say the word, and I'll obey.

168
00:13:28,040 --> 00:13:28,460
I shall...

169
00:13:28,790 --> 00:13:29,530
No, no.

170
00:13:29,590 --> 00:13:31,340
Your humble servant will see to it.

171
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:32,460
Keep an eye on her.

172
00:13:32,590 --> 00:13:33,100
As you command.

173
00:13:39,310 --> 00:13:41,140
If you ever run away again,

174
00:13:41,590 --> 00:13:42,470
it really would cause

175
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:43,460
some unnecessary trouble.

176
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,340
As long as I keep you alive,

177
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:47,650
breaking both your arms and legs

178
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,380
shouldn't be a problem, right?

179
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,140
You just saved my life.

180
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,810
Why would I run when I should be

181
00:13:55,950 --> 00:13:56,860
sticking close to you?

182
00:13:58,710 --> 00:13:59,620
You don't have to remind me.

183
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:00,740
I know what'll happen

184
00:14:00,790 --> 00:14:01,650
if I try to escape

185
00:14:01,670 --> 00:14:02,410
or lead you the wrong way.

186
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:03,810
I value my life.

187
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:06,170
I'd never do anything that foolish.

188
00:14:06,830 --> 00:14:08,100
What should I call you two?

189
00:14:08,710 --> 00:14:09,890
I'm Youyou.

190
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:14,890
I'm Yamao.

191
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:17,860
Qi Fengyin?

192
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,220
Yes, I know.

193
00:14:22,070 --> 00:14:23,620
Where's that woman who's carrying

194
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:24,620
my malice?

195
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:30,500
Mount Leiguan.

196
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:46,500
A helpless little girl managed to

197
00:14:47,310 --> 00:14:48,570
fool me for so long.

198
00:14:54,900 --> 00:14:57,020
[Mount Qihuang]

199
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:01,340
Master.

200
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:03,530
None of the sects have found

201
00:15:03,550 --> 00:15:04,460
any trace of Qi Fengyin.

202
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:05,530
I'm afraid

203
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,140
he's already escaped.

204
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,340
Qi Fengyin

205
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:10,690
may have broken Mount Qihuang's barrier,

206
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,050
but the Wanjun Lock

207
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,930
still managed to bind him.

208
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,140
With the divine artifact suppressing him,

209
00:15:16,550 --> 00:15:18,050
his power must be weakened.

210
00:15:18,830 --> 00:15:20,100
Before he becomes the Devil Incarnate,

211
00:15:20,430 --> 00:15:21,740
we still have a chance to stop him.

212
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:22,740
Hao,

213
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,410
send word to all the immortal sects.

214
00:15:26,590 --> 00:15:28,220
Send our disciples down the mountain, too.

215
00:15:28,590 --> 00:15:29,930
Search every last corner

216
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:31,770
until we capture that devil.

217
00:15:32,310 --> 00:15:32,740
Yes, Master.

218
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:33,890
Wait.

219
00:15:35,640 --> 00:15:36,570
Go to Mount Leiguan.

220
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:37,930
Find out

221
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,380
how Su Hexiang is doing.

222
00:15:40,830 --> 00:15:41,860
Everyone assumes

223
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:44,050
Qi Fengyin was simply too powerful,

224
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:46,500
so he shattered the Wanjun Lock's barrier.

225
00:15:47,430 --> 00:15:48,740
But I know what I saw.

226
00:15:49,950 --> 00:15:51,380
If Mount Leiguan's array

227
00:15:51,670 --> 00:15:52,570
hadn't suddenly failed

228
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:53,740
and dropped its defenses,

229
00:15:54,360 --> 00:15:54,980
everything

230
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,380
wouldn't have fallen apart so quickly.

231
00:15:57,830 --> 00:15:58,260
Hao,

232
00:15:59,590 --> 00:16:00,500
before you begin searching

233
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,500
for Qi Fengyin,

234
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:04,930
go to Mount Leiguan first.

235
00:16:05,170 --> 00:16:05,980
- Master! - Master!

236
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:06,690
Master!

237
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,220
Master, your internal injuries are severe.

238
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:23,530
You should stay here and recover in seclusion.

239
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:27,460
Now that Qi Fengyin

240
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:29,500
has been unleashed,

241
00:16:30,070 --> 00:16:30,650
Danshen

242
00:16:31,070 --> 00:16:31,890
has also died.

243
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,380
I must personally

244
00:16:34,070 --> 00:16:35,980
guard the Saintess's Shrine.

245
00:16:36,430 --> 00:16:37,340
Only then can I rest easy.

246
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:42,500
[Mount Leiguan]

247
00:16:42,500 --> 00:16:45,220
[Zixiao Retreat]

248
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,530
What are you doing here?

249
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:32,500
Wh-What's happening?

250
00:17:33,390 --> 00:17:34,260
The Wanjun Lock!

251
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:55,770
You...

252
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,850
Wh-What are you doing?

253
00:18:07,220 --> 00:18:08,650
The malice inside Su Hexiang

254
00:18:08,650 --> 00:18:09,730
is still on Mount Leiguan.

255
00:18:10,380 --> 00:18:12,130
But I can't pinpoint her location.

256
00:18:12,390 --> 00:18:13,460
That woman, Su Hexiang,

257
00:18:13,500 --> 00:18:14,610
must have found some way

258
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:15,810
to hide herself.

259
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:17,700
We'll search every inch of Mount Leiguan.

260
00:18:18,110 --> 00:18:19,020
We're bound to find her.

261
00:18:19,310 --> 00:18:21,420
Mount Leiguan is one of the Five Great Sects.

262
00:18:21,790 --> 00:18:22,850
If you cause such a scene,

263
00:18:23,110 --> 00:18:24,330
aren't you afraid the sects will attack?

264
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:25,900
I'll kill anyone who comes.

265
00:18:26,190 --> 00:18:27,020
Are we wiping out the whole sect?

266
00:18:27,220 --> 00:18:28,610
I'll clear the way for My Lord!

267
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:30,900
Neither of you is killing anyone!

268
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:37,090
Come on, let's go.

269
00:18:37,100 --> 00:18:37,690
Move, move.

270
00:18:37,690 --> 00:18:38,700
Hurry up!

271
00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:39,260
Over here!

272
00:18:44,590 --> 00:18:45,290
Qi Fengyin!

273
00:18:46,550 --> 00:18:47,980
If you really want your malice back,

274
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:48,740
you can't hurt

275
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:49,610
anyone here.

276
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,290
That'll only make things worse.

277
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:52,940
What do you mean, worse?

278
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:55,370
It means causing trouble we don't need.

279
00:18:58,870 --> 00:19:00,940
Every immortal sect is hunting you now.

280
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,940
If you reveal who you are

281
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:05,020
before you can reclaim your malice,

282
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:06,050
you'll have to face

283
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:07,260
an attack from all five sects and their allies.

284
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:08,160
Once the fighting starts,

285
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,130
it'll never end.

286
00:19:10,230 --> 00:19:10,770
Madam.

287
00:19:11,070 --> 00:19:12,940
Yuwen Hao, Chief Disciple of Mount Zhaowu,

288
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:13,980
requests an audience with you.

289
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,290
Yuwen Hao?

290
00:19:18,630 --> 00:19:20,500
Those immortals from Mount Zhaowu are the worst.

291
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:21,220
My Lord.

292
00:19:21,380 --> 00:19:22,500
Don't let them find you.

293
00:19:33,090 --> 00:19:34,940
I'm not receiving visitors today.

294
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:35,900
Send him away.

295
00:19:36,870 --> 00:19:37,370
Yes, Madam.

296
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:54,090
Mount Leiguan is one of the Five Great Sects,

297
00:19:54,550 --> 00:19:55,570
a respected immortal sect.

298
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:56,890
Yet Madam Su

299
00:19:57,300 --> 00:19:58,280
has taken in so many

300
00:19:58,280 --> 00:19:59,900
inner disciples with so little talent.

301
00:20:00,940 --> 00:20:01,830
She claims she's doing it

302
00:20:01,830 --> 00:20:03,660
to recruit talent and spread immortal arts.

303
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,020
But I think

304
00:20:05,550 --> 00:20:07,020
she's lost her devotion to cultivation.

305
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:08,370
It's disgraceful.

306
00:20:09,110 --> 00:20:10,420
In the old days, Mount Leiguan

307
00:20:10,590 --> 00:20:11,660
had strict rules.

308
00:20:12,310 --> 00:20:13,260
Its disciples' training

309
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:14,740
was especially grueling,

310
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,740
even tougher than Mount Zhaowu's.

311
00:20:17,350 --> 00:20:18,050
Who would've thought

312
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:19,700
that under her leadership,

313
00:20:20,370 --> 00:20:21,980
it would fall so far?

314
00:20:22,590 --> 00:20:23,090
Yinhua.

315
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,460
You and Zhiwei should keep your voices down.

316
00:20:25,830 --> 00:20:26,770
Someone might hear you.

317
00:20:27,110 --> 00:20:29,020
If Madam Su dares to act this way,

318
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:30,330
why should she care what people say?

319
00:20:36,520 --> 00:20:37,180
Sorry to keep you waiting.

320
00:20:38,830 --> 00:20:40,130
Our madam hasn't been feeling well lately.

321
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:40,980
She's unable to receive visitors.

322
00:20:41,110 --> 00:20:41,660
Please leave.

323
00:20:42,150 --> 00:20:42,810
I've come

324
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,460
on my master's orders to check on her.

325
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,570
I ask that Madam Su

326
00:20:45,870 --> 00:20:46,570
spare a moment to see us.

327
00:20:46,830 --> 00:20:47,660
I'm afraid that's not possible.

328
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:48,980
Please leave.

329
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:51,900
Then...

330
00:20:52,900 --> 00:20:53,850
Forgive the intrusion.

331
00:21:04,870 --> 00:21:05,330
Stop!

332
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,330
You can't come in here!

333
00:21:07,590 --> 00:21:08,770
I've heard Mount Zhaowu's disciples

334
00:21:08,790 --> 00:21:09,530
are careful with your words and actions.

335
00:21:09,620 --> 00:21:10,610
I never expected

336
00:21:10,630 --> 00:21:11,330
such thuggish behavior!

337
00:21:12,830 --> 00:21:14,090
These are our madam's private chambers.

338
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:14,980
You can't just barge in!

339
00:21:15,030 --> 00:21:16,050
If you anger her,

340
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:17,290
don't say I didn't warn you!

341
00:21:40,350 --> 00:21:40,980
What are you doing?

342
00:21:50,630 --> 00:21:51,290
Hao!

343
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:53,180
I've been hoping you'd come.

344
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:54,330
I knew you wouldn't let me down!

345
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:55,340
The last time we met

346
00:21:55,340 --> 00:21:56,290
was so long ago.

347
00:21:56,910 --> 00:21:57,920
Don't you remember me?

348
00:21:58,810 --> 00:21:59,660
Please show some restraint.

349
00:22:00,590 --> 00:22:01,180
Madam Su.

350
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:03,370
You...

351
00:22:04,280 --> 00:22:05,180
What did you just call me?

352
00:22:06,870 --> 00:22:07,700
Madam Su.

353
00:22:41,680 --> 00:22:42,090
No, I...

354
00:22:42,100 --> 00:22:43,180
My master sent me

355
00:22:43,230 --> 00:22:44,430
to check on you, Madam Su.

356
00:22:44,430 --> 00:22:46,080
Now that I see you're doing well,

357
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:46,810
I can put my mind at ease.

358
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:48,370
But there's something I don't understand.

359
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:50,330
When we tried to restore Mount Qihuang's seal,

360
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:51,370
Madam Su...

361
00:22:51,630 --> 00:22:52,700
Why did you suddenly withdraw your array?

362
00:22:53,240 --> 00:22:54,610
I... I didn't...

363
00:22:56,310 --> 00:22:56,770
I was...

364
00:23:03,210 --> 00:23:03,770
Wait here.

365
00:23:14,150 --> 00:23:15,260
To everyone else,

366
00:23:15,550 --> 00:23:16,400
I now look

367
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,220
exactly like Su Hexiang.

368
00:23:17,370 --> 00:23:18,370
Why did you do this?

369
00:23:18,630 --> 00:23:20,130
And why did you cast a silencing spell on me?

370
00:23:20,550 --> 00:23:21,330
You said

371
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:22,900
not to cause unnecessary trouble.

372
00:23:24,760 --> 00:23:26,420
You really know how to apply what you learn!

373
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:30,130
I need to keep Hao here

374
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:31,740
until I can tell him the truth.

375
00:23:39,440 --> 00:23:40,660
Master Du was concerned about me.

376
00:23:43,630 --> 00:23:44,740
About me, that is.

377
00:23:45,120 --> 00:23:46,560
He even sent his personal disciple

378
00:23:46,560 --> 00:23:47,460
to check on me.

379
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:48,980
I appreciate his concern.

380
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:51,020
We at Mount Leiguan

381
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:52,850
know how to treat our guests.

382
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,020
Prepare a feast.

383
00:23:54,550 --> 00:23:55,900
Let's give our young guests from Mount Zhaowu

384
00:23:55,960 --> 00:23:56,660
a proper welcome.

385
00:23:58,310 --> 00:23:58,940
Madam Su,

386
00:23:59,310 --> 00:23:59,770
there's no need.

387
00:24:01,790 --> 00:24:02,220
You there.

388
00:24:05,070 --> 00:24:06,530
Get him cleaned up and dressed properly.

389
00:24:07,280 --> 00:24:08,050
He's

390
00:24:08,110 --> 00:24:09,530
my newest inner disciple.

391
00:24:10,310 --> 00:24:11,420
Take good care of him.

392
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:13,220
Make sure he looks his very best.

393
00:24:14,390 --> 00:24:15,610
Didn't you tell me

394
00:24:16,280 --> 00:24:17,420
you wanted to stay on Mount Leiguan?

395
00:24:18,630 --> 00:24:19,420
In that case,

396
00:24:19,590 --> 00:24:20,850
you'll have to fit in

397
00:24:21,520 --> 00:24:22,740
and follow our rules.

398
00:24:25,500 --> 00:24:27,740
[Zixiao Retreat]

399
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:36,500
What kind of outfit is this?

400
00:24:36,660 --> 00:24:37,800
I'm

401
00:24:37,800 --> 00:24:39,370
a mighty ancient demon, after all.

402
00:24:43,070 --> 00:24:44,500
Why do you get to look so beautiful

403
00:24:44,590 --> 00:24:45,570
while I'm dressed so plainly?

404
00:24:45,790 --> 00:24:46,910
You think I'm happy about this?

405
00:24:47,060 --> 00:24:48,600
If your lord hadn't cast an illusion

406
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,700
and put a silencing spell on me,

407
00:24:50,070 --> 00:24:50,930
we wouldn't have to

408
00:24:50,930 --> 00:24:51,900
keep up this whole act.

409
00:24:57,620 --> 00:24:58,220
Someone's coming.

410
00:25:04,530 --> 00:25:05,350
Madam.

411
00:25:05,390 --> 00:25:07,290
We've brought you some new hairpins.

412
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:26,570
You're outer disciples, aren't you?

413
00:25:27,520 --> 00:25:28,610
Do you usually

414
00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:32,220
attend to me personally?

415
00:25:33,830 --> 00:25:35,500
Everyone else went to watch the show.

416
00:25:35,870 --> 00:25:37,130
Aren't you going to praise us, Madam?

417
00:25:37,480 --> 00:25:38,180
These hairpins

418
00:25:38,200 --> 00:25:39,530
were all made with our immortal powers.

419
00:25:41,870 --> 00:25:42,740
That's amazing!

420
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:46,440
Lately...

421
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:47,370
Things have been unsettled in the sect.

422
00:25:47,790 --> 00:25:48,700
You two, go back inside.

423
00:25:49,040 --> 00:25:50,090
Stay in your own courtyard.

424
00:25:50,960 --> 00:25:51,530
Don't come out.

425
00:25:51,720 --> 00:25:52,220
Do you hear me?

426
00:25:54,310 --> 00:25:55,500
Naughty little disciples

427
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:56,980
will get a spanking from this senior.

428
00:25:59,440 --> 00:26:00,700
We've learned our lesson.

429
00:26:05,390 --> 00:26:05,850
Well?

430
00:26:06,350 --> 00:26:07,260
Those people from Mount Zhaowu...

431
00:26:07,280 --> 00:26:08,460
Want me to throw them out, too?

432
00:26:08,590 --> 00:26:09,610
Go ahead. Just try it.

433
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:10,610
Wait.

434
00:26:11,830 --> 00:26:13,130
You're not

435
00:26:13,240 --> 00:26:14,660
planning to stir up trouble at the feast

436
00:26:14,790 --> 00:26:15,740
so His Lordship's identity

437
00:26:15,790 --> 00:26:16,610
gets exposed, are you?

438
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:18,500
Qi Fengyin may be out of touch,

439
00:26:19,150 --> 00:26:20,130
but he's not stupid.

440
00:26:20,920 --> 00:26:21,810
If I did that,

441
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:22,980
have you thought about what would happen?

442
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,900
If they found out right there,

443
00:26:25,040 --> 00:26:26,330
a fight would break out.

444
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:28,460
Those worthless fools

445
00:26:28,550 --> 00:26:29,740
are no match for His Lordship anyway.

446
00:26:31,490 --> 00:26:33,090
It's been ages since I've seen

447
00:26:33,090 --> 00:26:34,770
the immortal sects drenched in blood.

448
00:26:36,730 --> 00:26:37,570
What?

449
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:38,970
Listen to me.

450
00:26:39,590 --> 00:26:40,610
Qi Fengyin may have

451
00:26:40,610 --> 00:26:41,570
given you a human body,

452
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:43,260
but I'm the one who gathered your spirit

453
00:26:43,550 --> 00:26:44,700
using the doll

454
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:46,460
I sewed with my own hands.

455
00:26:48,260 --> 00:26:49,330
And inside your belly,

456
00:26:49,630 --> 00:26:51,050
there's still my thread of fate.

457
00:26:51,460 --> 00:26:52,580
I'm the only one

458
00:26:52,870 --> 00:26:53,900
who actually wants to protect you.

459
00:26:55,590 --> 00:26:56,180
Anyway,

460
00:26:56,550 --> 00:26:57,290
if anything happens to me,

461
00:26:57,550 --> 00:26:58,700
let's see how well

462
00:26:58,760 --> 00:26:59,610
a doll stuffed with cotton fares.

463
00:27:02,720 --> 00:27:04,370
Well, of course I'm on your side.

464
00:27:04,680 --> 00:27:05,610
So what's your plan?

465
00:27:07,520 --> 00:27:08,370
The people from Mount Zhaowu

466
00:27:08,480 --> 00:27:10,130
have already noticed something's wrong with me.

467
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:11,740
They'll definitely stay to investigate.

468
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:13,330
Unlike Mount Qihuang,

469
00:27:13,330 --> 00:27:13,980
where day and night are indistinguishable,

470
00:27:14,350 --> 00:27:15,460
once the moon comes out tonight,

471
00:27:15,760 --> 00:27:16,530
my powers will return.

472
00:27:16,790 --> 00:27:18,330
Then I can break that devil's spell.

473
00:27:18,960 --> 00:27:19,370
After that,

474
00:27:19,550 --> 00:27:20,700
I'll reveal myself to Hao

475
00:27:20,920 --> 00:27:21,770
and figure out our next move with him.

476
00:27:22,390 --> 00:27:22,940
Madam.

477
00:27:23,520 --> 00:27:23,980
Madam.

478
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:26,980
- Madam! - Madam!

479
00:27:28,310 --> 00:27:29,570
When did Madam

480
00:27:29,630 --> 00:27:30,570
slip into the hall without anyone noticing?

481
00:27:30,800 --> 00:27:31,750
I waited outside

482
00:27:31,750 --> 00:27:32,460
for quite a while,

483
00:27:32,590 --> 00:27:33,330
but I couldn't see you.

484
00:27:37,520 --> 00:27:39,290
Who's that ugly woman?

485
00:27:42,150 --> 00:27:44,220
She's my newest female disciple.

486
00:27:44,310 --> 00:27:45,260
A beautiful new disciple.

487
00:27:47,880 --> 00:27:48,420
Come.

488
00:27:48,720 --> 00:27:49,090
Sit.

489
00:27:57,390 --> 00:27:58,790
Now that all our young guests

490
00:27:58,790 --> 00:27:59,510
from Mount Zhaowu

491
00:27:59,510 --> 00:28:00,570
are here,

492
00:28:01,680 --> 00:28:02,660
let the feast begin.

493
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:25,370
Mount Qihuang's seal has been broken.

494
00:28:25,570 --> 00:28:26,980
Qi Fengyin is on the loose.

495
00:28:27,390 --> 00:28:28,740
The world's in chaos,

496
00:28:29,390 --> 00:28:31,130
yet Madam Su is still busy having fun.

497
00:28:32,000 --> 00:28:32,900
Master was worried

498
00:28:32,920 --> 00:28:33,770
something had happened to her.

499
00:28:33,870 --> 00:28:34,700
He sent us here specifically

500
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:35,460
to find out why she withdrew her array.

501
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:37,330
He clearly misjudged her.

502
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:38,090
Quiet.

503
00:28:39,240 --> 00:28:39,900
Yuwen,

504
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:41,500
Yinhua may be a little harsh,

505
00:28:41,720 --> 00:28:42,980
but she has a point.

506
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:44,900
We shouldn't judge others so quickly.

507
00:28:45,550 --> 00:28:46,180
Once we've

508
00:28:46,590 --> 00:28:48,130
found out why Mount Leiguan withdrew its array,

509
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,420
we'll return and report to Master.

510
00:28:50,310 --> 00:28:50,850
Yes.

511
00:28:55,120 --> 00:28:57,420
How can I get Hao to recognize me?

512
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:58,700
Madam, look.

513
00:29:00,790 --> 00:29:01,940
Those pills you gave me...

514
00:29:02,070 --> 00:29:03,130
I've only taken them for a few days,

515
00:29:03,210 --> 00:29:04,240
and my hair is already

516
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:05,390
jet-black and shiny.

517
00:29:06,520 --> 00:29:07,420
What do you think, Madam?

518
00:29:07,480 --> 00:29:08,320
Isn't it

519
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:09,220
much silkier than before?

520
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:10,530
Madam, look at mine.

521
00:29:10,880 --> 00:29:12,570
It smells better than anyone else's hair.

522
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:14,290
So this is what Su Hexiang likes?

523
00:29:15,550 --> 00:29:16,090
Madam.

524
00:29:16,840 --> 00:29:18,700
Is that a new hair ornament?

525
00:29:19,070 --> 00:29:20,260
How exquisite.

526
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:21,370
Let me have a look.

527
00:29:21,830 --> 00:29:22,260
Don't touch me!

528
00:29:22,390 --> 00:29:23,020
Get away.

529
00:29:40,310 --> 00:29:41,180
What's he doing here?

530
00:29:44,390 --> 00:29:45,420
His cultivation

531
00:29:45,790 --> 00:29:46,530
is far beyond the ordinary.

532
00:29:55,790 --> 00:29:56,530
Fengxian.

533
00:29:57,550 --> 00:29:58,660
Mind your manners.

534
00:30:04,240 --> 00:30:04,980
He's

535
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:06,530
my newest inner disciple.

536
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:07,850
Fengxian.

537
00:30:08,110 --> 00:30:09,180
He may have a nasty temper,

538
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:10,660
but he has a good heart.

539
00:30:15,410 --> 00:30:16,370
That'll be all.

540
00:30:16,530 --> 00:30:17,180
You may leave.

541
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:19,450
- Madam! - Madam!

542
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:20,740
None of you have any sense at all!

543
00:30:21,010 --> 00:30:22,500
Can't you see I'm entertaining guests?

544
00:30:22,720 --> 00:30:23,410
Look at the state of you!

545
00:30:23,410 --> 00:30:24,180
Have you no shame?

546
00:30:24,350 --> 00:30:24,740
Get out!

547
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:32,570
You too.

548
00:30:41,440 --> 00:30:42,020
Didn't we agree

549
00:30:42,070 --> 00:30:43,020
not to cause unnecessary trouble?

550
00:30:55,310 --> 00:30:57,530
Fengxian must be hungry.

551
00:31:06,870 --> 00:31:07,260
My Lord.

552
00:31:28,150 --> 00:31:28,770
Yuwen Hao.

553
00:31:30,040 --> 00:31:31,740
You said your master sent you

554
00:31:31,760 --> 00:31:32,770
to check on me.

555
00:31:33,760 --> 00:31:34,570
Madam Su,

556
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:36,130
the Five Great Sects

557
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:37,420
had agreed to form an array

558
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:39,220
to reinforce Mount Qihuang's seal.

559
00:31:39,720 --> 00:31:40,700
But just before the seal was restored,

560
00:31:40,870 --> 00:31:42,260
Mount Leiguan suddenly withdrew its array.

561
00:31:42,720 --> 00:31:43,570
This is a serious matter.

562
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:45,420
My master knows you

563
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:47,020
wouldn't withdraw without good reason.

564
00:31:47,630 --> 00:31:48,570
He was concerned

565
00:31:48,790 --> 00:31:49,610
something had happened at Mount Leiguan.

566
00:31:50,520 --> 00:31:50,980
That's right.

567
00:31:51,960 --> 00:31:53,570
I withdrew the array on purpose.

568
00:31:55,440 --> 00:31:56,420
Don't you think

569
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:57,500
Qi Fengyin

570
00:31:57,550 --> 00:31:58,660
has been locked up on Mount Qihuang for so long

571
00:31:59,790 --> 00:32:01,020
that perhaps he's already

572
00:32:01,040 --> 00:32:01,810
seen the error of his ways?

573
00:32:02,350 --> 00:32:03,740
I actually feel sorry for him.

574
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:06,420
Hao,

575
00:32:06,960 --> 00:32:08,660
please tell me you can read between the lines.

576
00:32:09,350 --> 00:32:10,850
How can you say that, Madam Su?

577
00:32:10,930 --> 00:32:11,860
Qi Fengyin is

578
00:32:11,860 --> 00:32:13,330
a bloodthirsty, ruthless devil!

579
00:32:13,520 --> 00:32:14,660
If we spare his life,

580
00:32:14,760 --> 00:32:16,370
do you really think he'd spare

581
00:32:16,390 --> 00:32:17,130
the lives of innocent people?

582
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:26,050
Madam Su,

583
00:32:27,110 --> 00:32:28,530
Qi Fengyin was born

584
00:32:28,530 --> 00:32:29,260
from the world's malice.

585
00:32:30,040 --> 00:32:31,020
He is evil itself.

586
00:32:31,300 --> 00:32:32,420
He can never turn to good.

587
00:32:32,880 --> 00:32:33,460
Yes.

588
00:32:34,680 --> 00:32:36,050
What I said earlier

589
00:32:36,380 --> 00:32:37,570
was indeed inappropriate.

590
00:32:39,950 --> 00:32:41,850
This is Mount Leiguan's finest wine.

591
00:32:42,590 --> 00:32:43,260
Consider it

592
00:32:43,870 --> 00:32:44,810
my apology.

593
00:32:54,830 --> 00:32:55,900
There's no need for that, Madam Su.

594
00:32:58,720 --> 00:32:59,220
Yuwen!

595
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:02,290
How unfortunate.

596
00:33:02,720 --> 00:33:04,740
Even magic can't get rid of that wine smell.

597
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:06,090
You'd better go change your clothes.

598
00:33:06,630 --> 00:33:07,090
Someone.

599
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:10,500
Take Yuwen Hao to bathe and change.

600
00:33:10,720 --> 00:33:11,180
Yes, Madam.

601
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:12,330
This way, please.

602
00:33:23,960 --> 00:33:24,940
My Lord...

603
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:32,980
- It's not my fault. - You...

604
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:34,380
He wanted to try it himself.

605
00:33:34,520 --> 00:33:35,960
How was I supposed to know one drop

606
00:33:36,040 --> 00:33:37,440
would knock him out like a little kid?

607
00:33:37,630 --> 00:33:38,330
Youyou.

608
00:33:39,240 --> 00:33:40,330
You've done me a huge favor.

609
00:33:44,010 --> 00:33:45,500
My young friends from Mount Zhaowu,

610
00:33:45,500 --> 00:33:46,090
help yourselves.

611
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:47,130
Make yourselves at home.

612
00:33:47,520 --> 00:33:48,770
I'll be back shortly.

613
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:55,700
Don't you think

614
00:33:56,350 --> 00:33:57,220
Madam Su

615
00:33:57,870 --> 00:33:58,770
is acting a little strange?

616
00:34:00,390 --> 00:34:01,370
She seems

617
00:34:01,790 --> 00:34:03,290
to keep staring at Yuwen.

618
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:05,220
Maybe she's

619
00:34:05,220 --> 00:34:06,180
fallen for him.

620
00:34:10,110 --> 00:34:11,300
Can't you carry him yourself?

621
00:34:11,300 --> 00:34:12,820
Do I look strong enough to lift him?

622
00:34:20,670 --> 00:34:21,650
He's so heavy.

623
00:34:24,270 --> 00:34:24,650
You...

624
00:34:26,920 --> 00:34:27,300
Let go.

625
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:28,340
Don't touch it.

626
00:34:31,320 --> 00:34:31,940
Touch what?

627
00:34:34,590 --> 00:34:35,460
Your mystical flower?

628
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:38,500
What exactly is it?

629
00:34:39,150 --> 00:34:40,300
Why do you treasure it so much?

630
00:34:41,520 --> 00:34:42,610
A thousand years of cultivation,

631
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:44,460
all to make this mystical flower bloom.

632
00:34:45,190 --> 00:34:46,730
And now you're even willing

633
00:34:47,230 --> 00:34:48,500
to disguise yourself as an immortal disciple for it.

634
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:51,940
Does it produce

635
00:34:52,320 --> 00:34:53,780
some legendary elixir when it blooms

636
00:34:54,270 --> 00:34:55,610
that makes you invincible?

637
00:34:55,960 --> 00:34:57,410
His Lordship became the Devil Incarnate

638
00:34:57,410 --> 00:34:58,860
just by absorbing malice.

639
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:00,210
Why would he need an elixir?

640
00:35:02,670 --> 00:35:03,940
Then what's so special about this flower?

641
00:35:07,750 --> 00:35:08,420
The flower...

642
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:11,420
holds her spirit.

643
00:35:15,590 --> 00:35:16,570
When it blooms,

644
00:35:17,960 --> 00:35:19,530
she can come back.

645
00:35:22,550 --> 00:35:23,170
She?

646
00:35:23,590 --> 00:35:24,340
Who's that?

647
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:26,460
Who?

648
00:35:29,420 --> 00:35:31,780
[Zixiao Retreat]

649
00:35:40,710 --> 00:35:42,660
Do you think His Lordship

650
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:44,730
was talking about a woman?

651
00:35:45,270 --> 00:35:45,820
Impossible.

652
00:35:46,110 --> 00:35:46,980
How could that devil

653
00:35:47,040 --> 00:35:48,020
ever have a love life?

654
00:35:49,190 --> 00:35:49,940
You never know.

655
00:36:07,600 --> 00:36:08,610
Oh, my!

656
00:36:08,740 --> 00:36:09,730
What on earth

657
00:36:09,750 --> 00:36:10,860
does Su Hexiang practice in here?

658
00:36:22,710 --> 00:36:23,610
This'll do.

659
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:29,690
You.

660
00:36:30,150 --> 00:36:30,860
Stay here and watch him.

661
00:36:31,550 --> 00:36:32,460
Don't let him wander off.

662
00:36:33,040 --> 00:36:34,130
And don't let anyone else in.

663
00:36:34,590 --> 00:36:35,090
Got it?

664
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:38,690
Or I'll burn

665
00:36:38,710 --> 00:36:39,650
your true form to ashes.

666
00:36:40,630 --> 00:36:41,090
Got it!

667
00:36:47,020 --> 00:36:54,220
[Zixiao Retreat]

668
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,300
No moonlight.

669
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:04,210
Just as I thought. No powers.

670
00:37:11,040 --> 00:37:11,420
You.

671
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:23,900
Madam.

672
00:37:24,040 --> 00:37:25,380
Do you know where Yuwen Hao...

673
00:37:27,880 --> 00:37:29,380
The chief disciple

674
00:37:29,710 --> 00:37:30,650
of Mount Zhaowu is right now?

675
00:37:31,110 --> 00:37:31,730
Have you

676
00:37:33,110 --> 00:37:34,730
started going after disciples from other sects too?

677
00:37:35,110 --> 00:37:35,530
What?

678
00:37:39,840 --> 00:37:41,250
No, you've got it all wrong.

679
00:37:41,590 --> 00:37:42,420
I'm not trying to

680
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:43,460
do anything inappropriate to him.

681
00:37:50,590 --> 00:37:51,050
Madam.

682
00:37:52,360 --> 00:37:52,900
This way, please.

683
00:38:20,400 --> 00:38:21,610
What a strange man.

684
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:23,090
He doesn't seem like a Mount Leiguan disciple.

685
00:38:23,750 --> 00:38:25,610
He doesn't fawn over people

686
00:38:25,670 --> 00:38:27,460
like Su Hexiang's inner disciples do.

687
00:38:33,110 --> 00:38:34,050
What am I thinking?

688
00:38:34,840 --> 00:38:35,940
To Hao,

689
00:38:36,230 --> 00:38:37,210
I look exactly

690
00:38:37,230 --> 00:38:38,050
like Su Hexiang right now.

691
00:38:38,590 --> 00:38:39,250
Why would he ever

692
00:38:39,270 --> 00:38:40,210
open the door for her?

693
00:38:46,070 --> 00:38:46,780
Please forgive me.

694
00:38:47,040 --> 00:38:48,130
You're the only one

695
00:38:48,520 --> 00:38:49,300
who can save my master now.

696
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,170
Hao, it's me.

697
00:39:05,670 --> 00:39:06,250
Hao.

698
00:39:06,710 --> 00:39:07,210
It's me!

699
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:12,500
Madam Su.

700
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:13,820
You're the leader of an immortal sect.

701
00:39:14,040 --> 00:39:14,650
Please show some restraint

702
00:39:15,190 --> 00:39:16,170
and don't cross the line.

703
00:39:16,270 --> 00:39:17,170
No, Hao!

704
00:39:17,220 --> 00:39:18,080
I have something important to tell you!

705
00:39:18,080 --> 00:39:19,280
I'm not here to watch you bathe!

706
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:20,120
I can only tell you in private.

707
00:39:20,120 --> 00:39:20,940
- If it's a private matter... - I...

708
00:39:21,270 --> 00:39:22,460
At least let me get dressed first.

709
00:39:22,630 --> 00:39:23,610
Please leave, Madam Su.

710
00:39:23,670 --> 00:39:24,750
Wait? I've waited so long

711
00:39:24,750 --> 00:39:25,530
for this chance!

712
00:39:25,630 --> 00:39:26,660
If I wait any longer, I'll lose it!

713
00:39:26,660 --> 00:39:27,360
In that case,

714
00:39:27,670 --> 00:39:28,730
I'll have to summon someone.

715
00:39:28,960 --> 00:39:29,380
Someone...

716
00:39:44,320 --> 00:39:44,860
I'm sorry.

717
00:39:56,440 --> 00:39:57,500
The man I brought back...

718
00:39:57,670 --> 00:39:58,380
He's actually...

719
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:01,730
He and Mount Qihuang...

720
00:40:06,270 --> 00:40:07,020
I really have no

721
00:40:07,040 --> 00:40:07,860
improper intentions toward you.

722
00:40:08,040 --> 00:40:09,090
I just want you to take me away!

723
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:09,940
Take you away?

724
00:40:16,800 --> 00:40:18,170
I can't tell you the truth right now.

725
00:40:18,440 --> 00:40:18,980
Madam Su.

726
00:40:19,750 --> 00:40:20,650
What exactly are you trying to say?

727
00:40:21,320 --> 00:40:22,420
You don't have to believe me.

728
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:23,820
Just take this with you.

729
00:40:41,630 --> 00:40:42,500
What are you doing here?

730
00:40:43,320 --> 00:40:43,780
I...

731
00:40:47,840 --> 00:40:48,170
I...

732
00:40:51,270 --> 00:40:52,130
Nothing happened

733
00:40:53,230 --> 00:40:54,380
between Madam Su and me.

734
00:41:32,110 --> 00:41:32,460
Let's go.

735
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:47,340
The spiritual mark is still intact.

736
00:41:48,230 --> 00:41:49,460
Looks like nothing happened.

737
00:41:50,270 --> 00:41:50,860
Yuwen.

738
00:41:51,320 --> 00:41:52,980
I was worried Madam Su spilled that wine

739
00:41:53,040 --> 00:41:54,090
because she had something improper in mind.

740
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:55,250
That's why I rushed over.

741
00:41:55,840 --> 00:41:56,690
Thank goodness you're all right.

742
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:00,860
Looks like

743
00:42:02,400 --> 00:42:03,530
we'll have to stay here tonight.

744
00:42:11,320 --> 00:42:12,690
Why are you looking at me?

745
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:13,940
Look how small I am.

746
00:42:14,320 --> 00:42:15,570
You think I could take him on?

747
00:42:15,750 --> 00:42:16,760
You could've at least kept him busy

748
00:42:16,760 --> 00:42:17,860
for a little longer.

749
00:42:18,230 --> 00:42:18,690
I...

750
00:42:30,710 --> 00:42:31,820
If you're so afraid of dying,

751
00:42:32,960 --> 00:42:34,170
why do you keep doing such foolish things?

752
00:42:39,000 --> 00:42:40,570
Haven't I done enough to help you?

753
00:42:40,980 --> 00:42:42,490
You turned me into Su Hexiang,

754
00:42:43,000 --> 00:42:44,300
and I did my best to play the part.

755
00:42:44,340 --> 00:42:45,500
I didn't want anyone suspecting you,

756
00:42:45,800 --> 00:42:47,380
so I even gave you a new identity.

757
00:42:48,000 --> 00:42:49,050
I've gone out of my way to cover for you

758
00:42:49,110 --> 00:42:50,500
so Mount Zhaowu wouldn't find out.

759
00:42:50,960 --> 00:42:52,380
You know nothing about the outside world,

760
00:42:52,550 --> 00:42:53,730
and I've been teaching you everything.

761
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:56,170
How much more considerate can I be?

762
00:43:16,590 --> 00:43:17,420
Then

763
00:43:18,920 --> 00:43:20,570
why did you sneak off to see that man?

764
00:43:22,590 --> 00:43:23,250
Because...

765
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:26,380
Because I like him.

766
00:43:44,440 --> 00:43:45,250
The disciple named Fengxian,

767
00:43:45,440 --> 00:43:46,460
who's always with Madam Su,

768
00:43:46,710 --> 00:43:47,420
has a mysterious past.

769
00:43:47,710 --> 00:43:48,460
He's not to be trusted.

770
00:43:48,630 --> 00:43:50,530
This man is nothing but trouble!

771
00:43:50,710 --> 00:43:51,860
Last night, I saw it all!

772
00:43:52,110 --> 00:43:53,020
He was using both hands

773
00:43:53,320 --> 00:43:54,300
to absorb black mist from the sky!

774
00:43:54,320 --> 00:43:54,690
Silence!

775
00:43:55,110 --> 00:43:56,210
Yuwen Hao's here.

776
00:43:59,040 --> 00:43:59,940
You've been kissed by a woman.

777
00:44:00,190 --> 00:44:00,820
You're not pure anymore.

778
00:44:23,100 --> 00:44:27,140
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

779
00:44:27,380 --> 00:44:30,820
♪So many longings♪

780
00:44:31,500 --> 00:44:33,580
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

781
00:44:33,780 --> 00:44:38,780
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

782
00:44:39,700 --> 00:44:43,740
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

783
00:44:43,980 --> 00:44:47,420
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

784
00:44:48,100 --> 00:44:50,180
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

785
00:44:50,380 --> 00:44:57,780
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

786
00:44:59,180 --> 00:45:02,860
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

787
00:45:03,100 --> 00:45:06,780
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

788
00:45:07,420 --> 00:45:10,980
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

789
00:45:11,300 --> 00:45:15,460
♪Still waits to come true♪

790
00:45:15,700 --> 00:45:19,380
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

791
00:45:19,940 --> 00:45:23,580
♪I'll stay by your side♪

792
00:45:24,060 --> 00:45:27,660
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

793
00:45:27,900 --> 00:45:35,220
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

794
00:45:48,700 --> 00:45:52,740
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

795
00:45:52,980 --> 00:45:56,420
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

796
00:45:57,100 --> 00:45:59,180
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

797
00:45:59,340 --> 00:46:06,780
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

798
00:46:07,700 --> 00:46:11,380
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

799
00:46:11,980 --> 00:46:15,580
♪I'll stay by your side♪

800
00:46:16,100 --> 00:46:19,660
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

801
00:46:19,900 --> 00:46:27,220
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
